{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"总体：C2/C3最稳，既写出安静只是暂时的，也明确这次的迟疑已有具体缘由；C1的回返感较强，但容易让人觉得他又回到了原初的茫然，C4这个问题更明显。keep：C2/C3用“刚才让自己安静了一会儿”承接S08，并用“这回知道自己为什么迟疑”保住他已经不再是原样茫然这一关键变化，同时保留了胆怯和舍不得的生活希望；C1次之，C4最弱，但四版都没有交代那份安宁为何值得他暂时停留，即S06真实发生过的满足感。cover：C2/C3把安静短暂、难题未解、迟疑缘由已明连在一起，最能解释珠子中稳定感消散却并非简单回到起点的意味；C1次之，C4的“又像当初那样”反而削弱了经历已经改变他的意味。lean：C2/C3没有额外加入挫败、绕行等心理说明，步骤最少；C1增加了挫败感和绕行感，C4又增加了走过很远的感慨，显得更拖沓。plain：C1的“绕了这么久还是碰上那个不知怎么办的自己”更像一个人带着挫败讲述自己的经历；C2/C3虽然清楚利落，但“这回知道自己为什么迟疑”略带解释性，C4的“走了这么远”则比较泛。C2与C3逐字相同，实质并列，列出C2在前仅为排序展示。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "59c56dd7-b640-41b0-ac99-8c9900a04829", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005106606209Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.421, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:51:44.029366+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7d769e18bcd82433eecd301b8ffcc4157b51d7a1162a337986676e4803f4806b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_